    "/ready": {
      "get": {
        "description": "就绪探针：聚合 degraded — probe PG (checkpoint), Cohere health, 返回 pg/checkpoint/billing。\n\nliveness/readiness 分流：mode=live 仅返回进程存活（不打 PG/网络探针，恒 200，由 /live 承担纯存活语义，\n/ready?mode=live 为其轻量别名）；默认 mode=ready 做全量就绪探针（5s 缓存 + 全局池超时 fail-closed）。\ncheckpoint 缺配与 billing fail-closed 以 reasons 透出；整体 degraded 时 503 + degraded:true + reason。\n所有探针经 _ready_run_with_timeout 有界执行（<5s 硬预算）；redis 为 warning 级真实状态；\n缺 COHERE_API_KEY 默认只 warning，HERO_READY_COHERE_FATAL=true 才降级。",
        "operationId": "ready_ready_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "mode",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "ready",
              "title": "Mode",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Ready"
      }
    },
